<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Emmis Broadcasting raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Emmis Broadcasting raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette upgraded Emmis Broadcasting Corp to buy from market perform, a DLJ source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1-3/8 to 34-1/2 in midmorning exchange trade.</p>
</text>
